// GeSe built-in effects: Time operators (handled by the renderer, no shader)

@effect Posterize Time
@id gese.time.posterize
@category Time
@desc Plays the layer at a lower frame rate (choppy stop-motion look).
@timeop posterize
@param float frameRate "Frame Rate" 8 0.5 120 fps

@effect Freeze Frame
@id gese.time.freeze
@category Time
@desc Holds a single moment of the layer (in layer time, seconds).
@timeop freeze
@param float holdAt "Hold At" 0 0 36000 sec
